{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34299","headline":"奉和袭美赠魏处士五贶诗 太湖砚 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美赠魏处士五贶诗 太湖砚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁截小秋滩，闲窥四绪宽。\n绕爲千嶂远，深置一潭寒。\n坐久云应出，诗成墨未乾。\n不知新博物，何处拟重刊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}